WEBVTT

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:06.204
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:12.574
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:29.484
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:30.224 --> 00:00:34.854
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:36.094 --> 00:00:41.364
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.904 --> 00:00:47.034
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.444 --> 00:00:50.974
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:51.044 --> 00:00:56.214
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.854 --> 00:01:01.344
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.924 --> 00:01:08.884
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.964 --> 00:01:14.874
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:21.504
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.774 --> 00:01:27.644
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:33.984
Okay, she's gone.

00:01:34.824 --> 00:01:35.794
Let's go.

00:01:35.854 --> 00:01:38.354
Mom says it's useless
for my entrance exams...

00:01:38.424 --> 00:01:39.484
...so I can't.

00:01:39.564 --> 00:01:40.684
Don't worry.

00:01:40.764 --> 00:01:43.524
She said she wouldn't
be back until tonight.

00:01:44.134 --> 00:01:46.624
Well, just for a little while, then.

00:01:46.774 --> 00:01:47.604
Okay.

00:02:13.124 --> 00:02:15.494
How should we search for them?

00:02:15.664 --> 00:02:18.224
It's an item that isn't in the specs.

00:02:19.104 --> 00:02:22.404
I wonder if Shino is on a date
with her boyfriend.

00:02:22.534 --> 00:02:23.564
A date?

00:02:23.674 --> 00:02:25.164
Of course not.

00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:27.144
She denied it last time.

00:02:27.214 --> 00:02:29.304
Stop jumping to
so many conclusions.

00:02:29.374 --> 00:02:30.744
Okay.

00:02:31.944 --> 00:02:33.974
- Did you believe me?
- Not really.

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:36.204
It doesn't matter, anyway.

00:02:40.424 --> 00:02:42.054
Are you jealous?

00:02:42.124 --> 00:02:43.354
Why would I be?

00:02:43.424 --> 00:02:46.194
Well, you always avoid
looking at her.

00:02:48.764 --> 00:02:51.324
A man can't face
the woman he adores.

00:02:52.804 --> 00:02:55.604
There's no treasure box
or monsters!

00:02:55.974 --> 00:02:58.944
How are we supposed
to find it here?!

00:02:59.004 --> 00:03:00.664
They could be on the ground.

00:03:00.744 --> 00:03:02.214
You know what?

00:03:02.544 --> 00:03:04.844
It's not gonna be that
easy to find them!

00:03:06.954 --> 00:03:09.714
I'd sure like to see them again.

00:03:27.134 --> 00:03:30.434
Just when I started
to enjoy the nice memories.

00:03:36.174 --> 00:03:38.144
I guess I'm just not that
kind of character.

00:03:48.694 --> 00:03:52.554
I should stop coming here.

00:04:04.274 --> 00:04:05.744
What is this?

00:04:05.874 --> 00:04:08.274
I never learned about these
at my prep school.

00:04:08.344 --> 00:04:09.644
I don't know!

00:04:09.714 --> 00:04:12.974
The manual didn't say there was
gonna be strong monsters here.

00:04:13.954 --> 00:04:16.044
That's why I didn't want to come.

00:04:28.094 --> 00:04:29.224
Are you okay?

00:04:29.434 --> 00:04:31.024
Uh, yeah.

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:32.694
What a relief!

00:04:34.104 --> 00:04:35.624
Thank you so much.

00:04:35.704 --> 00:04:37.504
Are you boys beginners?

00:04:37.844 --> 00:04:38.704
Yes.

00:04:38.774 --> 00:04:40.604
We just logged in.

00:04:40.844 --> 00:04:43.674
Come on, Yuta.
Say "thank you".

00:04:44.544 --> 00:04:47.384
It's not like we asked for help.

00:04:47.514 --> 00:04:49.984
And don't call me by my real name.

00:04:50.054 --> 00:04:51.524
Oh, sorry.

00:04:52.524 --> 00:04:54.614
Right. He's Cashmere.

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:55.914
Cashmere?

00:04:56.224 --> 00:04:57.524
And that's Wool.

00:04:57.724 --> 00:04:59.884
Cashmere and Wool.

00:05:00.794 --> 00:05:02.054
I'm Tabby!

00:05:02.164 --> 00:05:03.354
Nice to meet you!

00:05:10.844 --> 00:05:12.564
What a rare occasion.

00:05:13.644 --> 00:05:15.304
Why don't you sit down?

00:05:21.414 --> 00:05:24.474
Didn't you come here for a reason?

00:05:25.924 --> 00:05:28.984
Well, I don't really have a reason.

00:05:29.294 --> 00:05:30.254
I see.

00:05:33.024 --> 00:05:36.934
I think this area is a little too
difficult for beginners.

00:05:37.264 --> 00:05:39.234
Have you been playing
for a while, Tabby?

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:42.894
Kind of!

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:49.704
I was like you guys, and I didn't
know my right from my left.

00:05:50.214 --> 00:05:52.614
But lots of people helped me out.

00:05:54.154 --> 00:05:57.444
Anyway, I don't think that equipment
is good enough to keep you safe.

00:05:57.654 --> 00:06:01.094
The compatibility of items
depends on your PC.

00:06:02.054 --> 00:06:03.524
I'll teach you guys!

00:06:10.164 --> 00:06:11.694
Wow!

00:06:22.114 --> 00:06:24.674
Yes! It suits you both!

00:06:25.814 --> 00:06:28.714
She says it suits us, Yu-
I mean, Cashmere.

00:06:28.814 --> 00:06:30.184
She's just flattering us.

00:06:30.924 --> 00:06:35.414
I know you're helping us and all,
and maybe I shouldn't say this...

00:06:35.494 --> 00:06:36.454
What?

00:06:36.624 --> 00:06:39.924
Do you have some ulterior
motive with us?

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:42.794
It's too weird.

00:06:42.864 --> 00:06:44.894
You only just met us.

00:06:45.134 --> 00:06:47.724
What is this about?
Who exactly are you?

00:06:47.804 --> 00:06:48.774
Hey!

00:06:50.274 --> 00:06:53.764
Some people really helped
me out a while ago...

00:06:53.844 --> 00:06:56.004
...and I just wanted
to do the same for you.

00:06:56.074 --> 00:06:57.044
I guess.

00:07:00.144 --> 00:07:03.484
That's really all I can do, anyway.

00:07:07.494 --> 00:07:08.514
Okay!

00:07:11.994 --> 00:07:12.964
Let's go!

00:07:14.064 --> 00:07:15.394
Where?

00:07:15.564 --> 00:07:17.084
It's obvious!

00:07:17.164 --> 00:07:19.934
You'll use those items
to take revenge!

00:07:22.434 --> 00:07:25.374
I wonder where he is
and what he's doing?

00:07:25.444 --> 00:07:26.164
Huh?

00:07:26.574 --> 00:07:29.014
There was a guy like you.

00:07:30.244 --> 00:07:32.274
He was a beginner...

00:07:32.344 --> 00:07:37.284
...who seemed to have something
on his mind but wouldn't say it.

00:07:37.354 --> 00:07:40.944
He'd just stand there and listen
without saying a word.

00:07:43.154 --> 00:07:46.284
The Black Multi Weapon.

00:07:56.074 --> 00:07:59.134
Okay, I'll show you first.

00:07:59.374 --> 00:08:00.504
Watch me, okay?

00:08:04.714 --> 00:08:06.344
This'll be easy!

00:08:06.544 --> 00:08:08.674
Now! Take that!

00:08:08.814 --> 00:08:10.284
Hey, what do you think?

00:08:10.354 --> 00:08:13.254
Yeah, I don't think
she knows anything.

00:08:15.224 --> 00:08:16.484
I knew it.

00:08:16.624 --> 00:08:19.594
The manual says that when fighting
monsters with water attributes...

00:08:19.664 --> 00:08:23.324
...you use a fire component attack
rather than a strike attack.

00:08:23.434 --> 00:08:25.364
If it's an elemental hit...

00:08:25.764 --> 00:08:26.864
Using this...

00:08:27.704 --> 00:08:28.764
And this.

00:08:29.704 --> 00:08:31.574
A combination attack will do it!

00:08:36.244 --> 00:08:38.144
I think I'm in trouble.

00:08:50.964 --> 00:08:53.124
Do you know about attributes?

00:08:53.964 --> 00:08:55.194
Attributes?

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:05.504
Is that all you got?
Hey! Take this!

00:09:06.274 --> 00:09:07.334
Tabby, move!

00:09:17.114 --> 00:09:19.284
Wh-What was that?

00:09:19.584 --> 00:09:20.314
Huh?

00:09:20.384 --> 00:09:21.854
What do you mean?

00:09:21.994 --> 00:09:23.254
Are you serious?

00:09:23.324 --> 00:09:26.294
Are you sure you've been
playing this game for a while?

00:09:28.464 --> 00:09:30.594
With armored monsters...

00:09:30.664 --> 00:09:33.604
...you have to destroy
the shell first.

00:09:34.234 --> 00:09:36.794
Especially with crabs like that.

00:09:37.544 --> 00:09:39.534
Oh! The shell!

00:09:40.044 --> 00:09:41.404
Of course!

00:09:41.814 --> 00:09:43.404
If the shell breaks...

00:09:46.214 --> 00:09:48.944
I guess we can't use
black vinegar, huh?

00:10:13.274 --> 00:10:14.574
Oh, no!

00:10:14.844 --> 00:10:17.474
Wool, Cashmere,
take him from the right!

00:10:17.544 --> 00:10:19.134
I'll take him from the left.

00:10:20.244 --> 00:10:21.474
Are you sure about this?

00:10:21.554 --> 00:10:22.744
Wait for my signal!

00:10:22.814 --> 00:10:24.874
Three, two, one...

00:10:24.954 --> 00:10:25.784
Go!

00:10:26.884 --> 00:10:29.854
What are you doing?
The right! The right!

00:10:29.924 --> 00:10:30.724
You said right!

00:10:30.794 --> 00:10:31.854
That's the left!

00:10:31.924 --> 00:10:33.224
I don't get it!

00:10:33.294 --> 00:10:34.454
This is to the right!

00:10:34.864 --> 00:10:37.354
That's the left!
You're going left!

00:10:37.434 --> 00:10:40.454
Right from which perspective?
Be specific!

00:10:40.634 --> 00:10:43.624
That doesn't matter!
Right is right!

00:10:50.144 --> 00:10:51.234
We're finished.

00:11:01.794 --> 00:11:02.754
All right...

00:11:03.024 --> 00:11:04.114
You're leaving?

00:11:04.694 --> 00:11:06.824
There's no use in me being here.

00:11:06.894 --> 00:11:09.524
You're the one that came here.

00:11:09.594 --> 00:11:10.654
Yeah, well...

00:11:11.234 --> 00:11:15.034
I sure have seen some
unusual ones today.

00:11:22.844 --> 00:11:24.174
I see.

00:11:24.844 --> 00:11:27.814
If it was Shino or Teacher,
it would have been fine.

00:11:27.884 --> 00:11:29.444
But I'm useless.

00:11:30.054 --> 00:11:32.744
Don't get so down on yourself.

00:11:33.254 --> 00:11:38.654
A game should be fun. Why don't you try
to enjoy it with your new friends?

00:11:38.724 --> 00:11:40.194
We're not friends.

00:11:40.494 --> 00:11:41.624
We're brothers.

00:11:41.694 --> 00:11:44.134
What?! I thought you guys
were friends!

00:11:45.004 --> 00:11:46.054
Are you the younger one?

00:11:46.134 --> 00:11:48.104
Uh, no. It's the other way around.

00:11:48.234 --> 00:11:49.034
I'm older.

00:11:51.804 --> 00:11:53.134
I've had enough.

00:11:53.304 --> 00:11:55.334
I'm quitting this game.

00:11:56.244 --> 00:11:57.214
Cashmere...

00:11:57.944 --> 00:12:00.674
Well, it is "only" a game.

00:12:01.284 --> 00:12:05.584
However, it is indeed a game.

00:12:07.854 --> 00:12:08.884
Cashmere!

00:12:10.254 --> 00:12:11.884
What should we do?

00:12:11.964 --> 00:12:15.224
I don't know what's going on,
but it's getting complicated...

00:12:15.294 --> 00:12:16.554
...so, I'll be going now.

00:12:16.634 --> 00:12:21.334
Why don't you challenge
those two to a quest again...

00:12:21.404 --> 00:12:22.564
...young lady?

00:12:23.034 --> 00:12:23.934
But...

00:12:24.004 --> 00:12:24.934
Don't worry.

00:12:25.004 --> 00:12:27.734
There's someone here with
plenty of time to spare.

00:12:28.144 --> 00:12:30.404
This time they won't fail.

00:12:38.984 --> 00:12:42.114
Okay, Tabby, Wool and Cashmere...

00:12:42.494 --> 00:12:44.254
You joined "The World"...

00:12:46.224 --> 00:12:48.524
Obviously you two are beginners.

00:12:48.994 --> 00:12:50.824
And you're sort of experienced?

00:12:50.904 --> 00:12:51.864
Yup!

00:12:52.434 --> 00:12:54.764
I'm actually very busy
with many things.

00:12:54.834 --> 00:13:00.574
So I'm asking myself whether or not
I really want to take the time...

00:13:00.914 --> 00:13:03.204
...to specially train you
to be top-notch PCs.

00:13:03.374 --> 00:13:04.844
Please do!

00:13:05.144 --> 00:13:06.114
Um...

00:13:06.384 --> 00:13:08.114
Oh, it's Kuhn.

00:13:08.914 --> 00:13:09.614
Um...

00:13:09.684 --> 00:13:10.614
What?

00:13:10.684 --> 00:13:13.124
Can this be done by today?

00:13:13.254 --> 00:13:14.774
Maybe by tonight?

00:13:15.294 --> 00:13:19.784
We have to log out before
our parents get home tonight.

00:13:20.294 --> 00:13:23.234
They can't know we're here.

00:13:23.764 --> 00:13:25.254
It doesn't matter.

00:13:25.334 --> 00:13:29.324
If I log out myself,
you won't get in trouble.

00:13:29.404 --> 00:13:31.134
That's not the problem.

00:13:31.344 --> 00:13:32.774
That's exactly the problem.

00:13:33.044 --> 00:13:34.004
Uh...

00:13:34.074 --> 00:13:35.104
What's this about?

00:13:35.244 --> 00:13:37.474
You're no good at studying, are you?

00:13:42.314 --> 00:13:45.154
Wait a second, kid.

00:13:46.024 --> 00:13:48.684
This nice guy here...

00:13:48.754 --> 00:13:50.984
...will teach you...

00:13:51.664 --> 00:13:53.564
...all the rules of the game.

00:13:54.534 --> 00:13:55.494
Oh, boy...

00:13:56.064 --> 00:13:57.494
What do you want?!

00:13:57.564 --> 00:13:59.464
I don't like your attitude!

00:13:59.534 --> 00:14:00.834
Don't mess with me!

00:14:03.004 --> 00:14:05.594
Hey, what was that all about?

00:14:07.004 --> 00:14:11.004
My brother's busy preparing
for his junior high entrance exams.

00:14:11.214 --> 00:14:13.614
Our parents have a rule
that forbids him...

00:14:13.684 --> 00:14:17.514
...from anything that doesn't
have to do with his exams.

00:14:17.984 --> 00:14:21.784
They weren't that strict with me.

00:14:22.194 --> 00:14:25.554
But ever since I failed my exams...

00:14:25.624 --> 00:14:28.064
...my mom completely changed.

00:14:28.134 --> 00:14:30.184
She's obsessed with
our education now.

00:14:30.634 --> 00:14:34.064
All that pressure
is on my brother now.

00:14:35.304 --> 00:14:39.464
My brother's having a hard time
because of me.

00:14:40.344 --> 00:14:44.874
So, because my brother's wanted
to play this game for a while...

00:14:44.984 --> 00:14:47.314
...we waited for
our parents to leave...

00:14:47.414 --> 00:14:49.174
...and logged in secretly.

00:14:50.514 --> 00:14:51.484
I see.

00:14:52.084 --> 00:14:52.914
Let go of me!

00:14:52.984 --> 00:14:56.544
I'd rather be studying than
playing a game like this!

00:14:56.624 --> 00:14:57.644
Oh really.

00:15:03.534 --> 00:15:04.794
Studying, huh?

00:15:05.504 --> 00:15:07.664
Well, you're right.

00:15:07.734 --> 00:15:09.894
I was never good at studying.

00:15:10.604 --> 00:15:11.734
I was right.

00:15:12.644 --> 00:15:13.604
But...

00:15:15.814 --> 00:15:21.244
There are plenty of idiots
who only know how to study, too.

00:15:32.024 --> 00:15:34.824
I have an older sister.

00:15:36.434 --> 00:15:39.734
She's totally different from me.

00:15:40.534 --> 00:15:42.834
She's really good at studying.

00:15:43.404 --> 00:15:47.674
So my parents have
a lot of hope for her.

00:15:48.974 --> 00:15:52.704
Sometimes I'm envious,
but it must be difficult for her, too.

00:15:53.584 --> 00:15:56.414
I mean, I don't really understand it.

00:16:02.324 --> 00:16:06.814
I wonder what it's like to have
someone believe in you like that.

00:16:09.264 --> 00:16:10.354
I think...

00:16:11.304 --> 00:16:12.894
It feels like that.

00:16:14.004 --> 00:16:15.404
Like what?

00:16:15.734 --> 00:16:18.334
Like how you must be
feeling right now...

00:16:18.404 --> 00:16:20.634
The feeling that
someone believes in you.

00:16:25.844 --> 00:16:30.614
We've said a lot of things,
but we're still depending on you.

00:16:31.184 --> 00:16:34.644
That's what believing in
someone's all about, isn't it?

00:16:37.024 --> 00:16:37.994
Hey!

00:16:38.264 --> 00:16:39.224
We're going!

00:16:39.724 --> 00:16:40.664
Okay!

00:16:41.064 --> 00:16:43.754
What am I supposed to do?
Hey, what am I supposed to do?!

00:16:43.834 --> 00:16:44.794
I wonder.

00:16:45.564 --> 00:16:48.434
I hate stupid people
who can't study!

00:16:48.874 --> 00:16:51.564
If you stay calm
everything will be okay!

00:16:51.674 --> 00:16:52.574
Okay.

00:16:55.474 --> 00:16:57.444
Okay, off you go.

00:17:01.154 --> 00:17:02.204
Oh, boy!

00:17:02.614 --> 00:17:03.744
You can do it!

00:17:13.024 --> 00:17:14.514
That was terrible!

00:17:14.934 --> 00:17:16.594
I mean, terrible!

00:17:16.934 --> 00:17:18.664
You're not teaching us properly.

00:17:18.734 --> 00:17:22.504
I don't really know what to say,
but let's try harder next time.

00:17:23.074 --> 00:17:24.034
Okay.

00:17:32.884 --> 00:17:34.044
See?

00:17:34.414 --> 00:17:35.544
That's it!

00:17:38.784 --> 00:17:39.614
You!

00:17:39.684 --> 00:17:40.814
Stop making excuses!

00:17:40.884 --> 00:17:41.854
You!

00:17:41.924 --> 00:17:43.824
Try voicing your own opinion!

00:17:43.994 --> 00:17:45.394
And you!

00:17:45.464 --> 00:17:48.254
Meaningless cheer and vigor
won't amount to anything!

00:17:53.634 --> 00:17:56.574
Well, we're running out of time.

00:17:57.434 --> 00:18:01.344
So let's get this one down
before your mom gets home.

00:18:02.114 --> 00:18:02.904
Huh?

00:18:05.644 --> 00:18:06.614
Revenge.

00:18:14.354 --> 00:18:15.324
Huh?

00:18:20.994 --> 00:18:24.834
This is the place where
we were beaten, right?

00:18:26.364 --> 00:18:27.234
It's here!

00:18:27.304 --> 00:18:28.704
A huge one!

00:18:32.374 --> 00:18:33.804
Tabby, don't do anything.

00:18:33.874 --> 00:18:34.774
Huh?

00:18:34.914 --> 00:18:36.844
Let those two take care of it.

00:18:37.314 --> 00:18:38.044
But...

00:18:38.114 --> 00:18:40.244
They will have to do it
on their own.

00:18:42.784 --> 00:18:44.914
I'm sure we'll be fine this time.

00:18:44.984 --> 00:18:46.314
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:47.254 --> 00:18:48.224
We can.

00:18:48.494 --> 00:18:49.654
We can do it!

00:18:51.694 --> 00:18:54.214
Cashmere, you take him
from the right.

00:18:54.634 --> 00:18:56.464
I'll come at him from
the other side.

00:18:56.964 --> 00:19:00.794
And while I've distracted him,
you strike him down.

00:19:01.004 --> 00:19:01.974
Let's go!

00:19:02.534 --> 00:19:05.024
Hey, it's not all up to you!

00:19:08.214 --> 00:19:10.114
Hey, it's looking bad!

00:19:10.414 --> 00:19:11.814
Help him out!

00:19:12.314 --> 00:19:13.004
Kuhn!

00:19:13.084 --> 00:19:14.874
We have to help them, or...!

00:19:15.014 --> 00:19:15.984
They're fine.

00:19:16.754 --> 00:19:19.684
Hey, are you just all talk?

00:19:19.754 --> 00:19:21.984
You gonna cower like that
when it gets tough?

00:19:23.854 --> 00:19:27.984
You're actually also an idiot
who doesn't know how to study...

00:19:28.064 --> 00:19:29.154
...aren't you?

00:19:32.134 --> 00:19:37.364
Your brother did his best to cover
for you and bring you here.

00:19:37.904 --> 00:19:39.964
Is that all you can do? Huh?

00:19:52.824 --> 00:19:53.754
Yuta!

00:19:55.124 --> 00:19:57.284
It's Cashmere, bro!

00:19:58.394 --> 00:20:00.654
Lookin' good, Cashmere!

00:20:00.964 --> 00:20:02.124
Well...

00:20:02.194 --> 00:20:03.924
It's your turn now, Tabby!

00:20:04.294 --> 00:20:05.234
Huh?

00:20:05.534 --> 00:20:07.524
In a critical situation like this...

00:20:07.604 --> 00:20:09.794
...do you know what's most needed?

00:20:11.474 --> 00:20:12.404
Let's see...

00:20:12.974 --> 00:20:17.204
A positive attitude that will help
overcome the crisis.

00:20:19.744 --> 00:20:20.714
Yup!

00:20:21.414 --> 00:20:24.474
Okay! Do exactly as I say!

00:20:24.754 --> 00:20:27.884
Once the timing is right
use your Rengeki!

00:20:29.024 --> 00:20:30.424
Can we do it?

00:20:30.594 --> 00:20:31.824
Yeah, we can!

00:20:32.064 --> 00:20:33.024
All right!

00:20:36.664 --> 00:20:37.634
Now!

00:20:45.844 --> 00:20:46.774
Hey, bro?

00:20:47.544 --> 00:20:48.534
Yeah?

00:20:49.414 --> 00:20:50.814
I had fun today.

00:20:52.114 --> 00:20:53.134
Thanks.

00:20:54.284 --> 00:20:55.254
Right.

00:20:55.884 --> 00:20:59.414
After you finish your exams,
let's play this game again.

00:21:01.154 --> 00:21:01.914
Yeah.

00:21:14.774 --> 00:21:17.064
Well, and that's that.

00:21:17.874 --> 00:21:21.174
It seems like you've
enjoyed yourself.

00:21:21.914 --> 00:21:22.874
I guess...

00:21:22.974 --> 00:21:26.144
I wonder what those two
are doing right now.

00:21:26.414 --> 00:21:27.434
Who knows?

00:21:29.054 --> 00:21:32.884
I guess complete beginners
aren't all that bad.

00:21:33.084 --> 00:21:35.384
Everyone starts off as a beginner.

00:21:36.124 --> 00:21:37.024
Yup.

00:21:37.094 --> 00:21:38.054
Not bad.

00:21:40.964 --> 00:21:41.934
Later!

00:21:42.064 --> 00:21:44.464
He's a strange one.

00:21:45.464 --> 00:21:46.934
Young lady...

00:21:47.204 --> 00:21:49.134
What are you going to do now?

00:21:49.434 --> 00:21:51.094
I don't know.

00:21:51.374 --> 00:21:52.344
I see.

00:21:52.544 --> 00:21:55.444
But I'm going to stick it out here
a little longer.

00:21:56.374 --> 00:22:00.374
Maybe there's something here
that even I can do.

00:22:01.184 --> 00:22:03.044
Oh, yes, young lady...

00:22:03.284 --> 00:22:03.684
Huh?

00:22:04.154 --> 00:22:05.554
You dropped this.

00:22:08.724 --> 00:22:12.524
Keep it for another time, okay?

00:22:14.794 --> 00:22:15.624
Okay!

00:22:30.244 --> 00:22:33.844
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.914 --> 00:22:37.354
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.614 --> 00:22:41.024
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:41.084 --> 00:22:45.454
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.894 --> 00:22:52.424
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.504 --> 00:22:56.264
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.334 --> 00:23:03.574
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru
beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.644 --> 00:23:07.304
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.384 --> 00:23:11.074
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:11.154 --> 00:23:18.084
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.264 --> 00:23:21.924
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.994 --> 00:23:25.024
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:25.104 --> 00:23:32.634
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.874 --> 00:23:36.364
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:36.474 --> 00:23:40.174
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.384 --> 00:23:43.814
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.884 --> 00:23:47.444
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.524 --> 00:23:51.254
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.324 --> 00:23:54.694
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:56.134 --> 00:23:57.324
Next Episode
